<text sect=""><![CDATA[<p align="left">[00:00]<b>CD2 Track 38</b></p>]]></text>
<text sect=""><![CDATA[<p align="left"><b>W = Woman, M = Man</b></p>]]></text>
<text sect="W:"><![CDATA[<p align="left">[00:04.9]OK … we’re going to play the ‘Yes-No’ game. `[00:08.6]Do you know how to play?</p>]]></text>
<text sect="M:"><![CDATA[<p align="left">[00:10]No, I’ve never played that. `[00:12.1]How do you play?</p>]]></text>
<text sect="W:"><![CDATA[<p align="left">[00:13]Well, basically, I ask you questions and you must not answer with either ‘Yes’ or ‘No’.</p>]]></text>
<text sect="M:"><![CDATA[<p align="left">[00:19]What can I say, then?</p>]]></text>
<text sect="W:"><![CDATA[<p align="left">[00:21.7]You can say anything else … like … ‘I’m not sure’, or ‘Maybe’, or ‘I’ll think about it’, or ‘Definitely’. `[00:33]You know, anything else, but not ‘Yes’ or ‘No’.</p>]]></text>
<text sect="M:"><![CDATA[<p align="left">[00:37]OK. `[00:38.5]That sounds easy!</p>]]></text>
<text sect="W:"><![CDATA[<p align="left">[00:39.8]OK. `[00:40.9]Let’s start. `[00:41.9]Ready?</p>]]></text>
<text sect="M:"><![CDATA[<p align="left">[00:42.9]Y … umm … I am!</p>]]></text>
<text sect="W:"><![CDATA[<p align="left">[00:46.4]OK. `[00:48]Have you seen any good films recently?</p>]]></text>
<text sect="M:"><![CDATA[<p align="left">[00:51]I have.</p>]]></text>
<text sect="W:"><![CDATA[<p align="left">[00:52]Have you ever seen a film that changed your life?</p>]]></text>
<text sect="M:"><![CDATA[<p align="left">[00:55.9]Maybe.</p>]]></text>
<text sect="W:"><![CDATA[<p align="left">[00:57.9]Did you say ‘Maybe’?</p>]]></text>
<text sect="M:"><![CDATA[<p align="left">[01:00]Err … I’m not sure.</p>]]></text>
<text sect="W:"><![CDATA[<p align="left">[01:03]What about <i>Yes Man</i>? `[01:05.4]Have you seen that?</p>]]></text>
<text sect="M:"><![CDATA[<p align="left">[01:06.8]I have.</p>]]></text>
<text sect="W:"><![CDATA[<p align="left">[01:08]You have? `[01:10]Really?</p>]]></text>
<text sect="M:"><![CDATA[<p align="left">[01:10.8]Yes! `[01:11.3]Ohhhh! `[01:12.5]You tricked me …</p>]]></text>
<text sect="W:"><![CDATA[<p align="left">[01:13.8]That’s the idea!</p>]]></text>
<text sect="M:"><![CDATA[<p align="left">[01:16]OK … now I’ll ask you. `[01:18]Ready?</p>]]></text>
<text sect="W:"><![CDATA[<p align="left">[01:18.8]Definitely.</p>]]></text>
<text sect="M:"><![CDATA[<p align="left">[01:20]Right. `[01:21.4]Are you going to go on holiday this summer?</p>]]></text>
<text sect="W:"><![CDATA[<p align="left">[01:24.8]I’ve told you that.</p>]]></text>
<text sect="M:"><![CDATA[<p align="left">[01:27]Are you going to the seaside?</p>]]></text>
<text sect="W:"><![CDATA[<p align="left">[01:30]Sure.</p>]]></text>
<text sect="M:"><![CDATA[<p align="left">[01:31]Are you looking forward to it?</p>]]></text>
<text sect="W:"><![CDATA[<p align="left">[01:33]I certainly am.</p>]]></text>
<text sect="M:"><![CDATA[<p align="left">[01:35]Oh. What can I ask you? `[01:39]Do you believe in fate?</p>]]></text>
<text sect="W:"><![CDATA[<p align="left">[01:41.9]Fate?</p>]]></text>
<text sect="M:"><![CDATA[<p align="left">[01:43]Yes, do you believe in fate? `[01:45.8]You know, that our lives are planned already somehow, and you can’t change them?</p>]]></text>
<text sect="W:"><![CDATA[<p align="left">[01:52.7]Not at all. `[01:54.3]I believe that you can change a lot about your life.</p>]]></text>
<text sect="M:"><![CDATA[<p align="left">[01:58]So you don’t believe in fate?</p>]]></text>
<text sect="W:"><![CDATA[<p align="left">[01:59.9]No, I don’t!</p>]]></text>
<text sect="M:"><![CDATA[<p align="left">[02:01]Got you! `[02:03.2]You said ‘No’.</p>]]></text>
</data>